#DESCRIPTION
Hybrid-PIC upwind (Rusanov) dissipation in a noisy 2D plasma: kinetic ions,
Hall term on, MC-limited reconstruction with the full whistler signal speed,
no hyper-resistivity and no div(B) cleaning. The upwind term is part of the
nodal E, so the node-to-center curl of the Faraday update must leave the
discrete div(B) unchanged; the validator compares div(B) at the first and the
last plot.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
-3.2                    xMin  [code units; Lx = 6.4 d_i]
 3.2                    xMax
-3.2                    yMin
 3.2                    yMax
-0.05                   zMin
 0.05                   zMax

#NCELL
32                      nCellX
32                      nCellY
1                       nCellZ

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
16                      maxBlockSizeX
16                      maxBlockSizeY
1                       maxBlockSizeZ

#PERIODICITY
T                       isPeriodicX
T                       isPeriodicY
T                       isPeriodicZ

#SOLVEEM
F                       solveEM

#FIELDINTEGRATOR
rk4                     fieldIntegrator

#HYBRIDPIC
T                       useHybridPIC

#HYBRIDUPWIND
T                       useHybridUpwind
mc                      upwindLimiter
1.0                     upwindCoefWhistler
1.0                     upwindSensorFloor

#RESISTIVITY
0.0                     etaResistivity  [m^2/s]

#ELECTRONTEMPERATURE
0.0                     electronTemperature  [eV]
1.0                     electronGamma
1.0                     electronDensity0

#BSUBCYCLE
8                       nBSubcycle

#DIVB
F                       useHyperbolicCleaning
T                       alwaysComputeDivB

#PLASMA
1                       nSpecies
1.0                     mass
1.0                     charge

#UNIFORMSTATE
5.0                     rho [/cc]
0.0                     ux [km/s]
0.0                     uy [km/s]
0.0                     uz [km/s]
10000.0                 T [K]
1.0439e-8               bx [T]      guide field Bx0 (B_code ~ 1)
0.0                     by [T]
0.0                     bz [T]
0.0                     ex [V/m]
0.0                     ey [V/m]
0.0                     ez [V/m]

#TESTCASE
HybridWave

#WAVEIC
T                       rightHand
1                       waveMode

#TIMESTEPPING
T                       useFixedDt
0.02                    dt

#NORMALIZATION
1.0e5                   lNormSI   [m]
1.0e5                   uNormSI   [m/s]

#MONITOR
50                      dnReport

#SAVELOG
10                      dnSavePic
10                      dnSavePT

#PARTICLES
20                      nParticle per cell in X
20                      nParticle per cell in Y
1                       nParticle per cell in Z

#SAVEPLOT
1                       nPlot
z=0 var ascii pic       plotString
-1                      dn
2.0                     dt
1                       dx
Bx By Bz divB           plotVar

#STOP
-1                      MaxIter
2.0                     TimeMax
